{"seq":1,"slug":"package-management-pub","title":"Pub 包管理与发布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/ecosystem/package-management-pub","wordCount":1226,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"pub-包管理与发布\">Pub 包管理与发布</h1><p>Dart 的包管理器 Pub 采用<strong>版本解析</strong>（version solving）而非简单的版本锁定——它在满足所有传递依赖约束的前提下寻找兼容的包版本组合。理解 Pub 的依赖解析算法、pubspec 语义化版本约束和发布流程，是维护健康 Dart 项目的基础能力。截至 2026 年，pub.dev 托管超过 50,000 个公开包，月下载量数十亿次。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>先立起本篇的几张底牌，后文所有论证都围绕它们展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>一句话定义</th>\n<th>在本篇中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>版本解析</td>\n<td>在满足所有传递约束下找最新兼容组合</td>\n<td>Pub 区别于版本锁定的核心能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>caret 约束</td>\n<td><code>^1.2.3</code> 意为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>1.2.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 1.2.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.2.3</span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2.0.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 2.0.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.0.0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>推荐的默认约束写法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pubspec.lock</td>\n<td>记录解析后的精确版本，保证可复现</td>\n<td>应用提交、库不提交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>workspace</td>\n<td>让 monorepo 内多个包共享同一解析单元</td>\n<td>避免内部包互相冲突</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pub Points</td>\n<td>pub.dev 的 160 分质量评分体系</td>\n<td>发布后的质量反馈信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>私有仓库</td>\n<td>通过 hosted 或 <code>PUB_HOSTED_URL</code> 指向企业源</td>\n<td>企业环境的落地方式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话串起来：版本解析决定依赖如何被选中，caret 约束与 lock 文件决定可复现性，workspace 解决 monorepo 内部冲突，Pub Points 与私有仓库覆盖公开发布与企业分发两端。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pubspec-yaml-解析\">pubspec.yaml 解析</h2><p><code>pubspec.yaml</code> 是 Dart 包的唯一元数据入口，定义了名称、版本、依赖和环境约束：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: my_http_client&#10;description: A type-safe HTTP client with retry and caching.&#10;version: 2.1.0&#10;repository: https://github.com/example/my_http_client&#10;&#10;environment:&#10;  sdk: ^3.12.0 # 最低 Dart SDK 版本&#10;&#10;dependencies:&#10;  http: ^1.2.0 # pub.dev 上的包&#10;  retry: &#39;&gt;=4.0.0 &lt;5.0.0&#39; # 等价于 ^4.0.0 的显式写法&#10;  path: any # 接受任何版本（不推荐）&#10;&#10;dev_dependencies:&#10;  test: ^1.25.0&#10;  lints: ^5.0.0&#10;  build_runner: ^2.4.0&#10;  mockito: ^5.4.0&#10;&#10;dependency_overrides: # 仅用于开发调试，不传递给下游&#10;  http:&#10;    path: ../http_fork\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my_http_client</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">A type-safe HTTP client with retry and caching.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">repository</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://github.com/example/my_http_client</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  sdk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">^3.12.0</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 最低 Dart SDK 版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dependencies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">^1.2.0</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # pub.dev 上的包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  retry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'>=4.0.0 &#x3C;5.0.0'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 等价于 ^4.0.0 的显式写法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">any</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 接受任何版本（不推荐）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dev_dependencies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">^1.25.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  lints</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">^5.0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  build_runner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">^2.4.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  mockito</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">^5.4.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dependency_overrides</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 仅用于开发调试，不传递给下游</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">../http_fork</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束语法</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>^1.2.3</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>1.2.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 1.2.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.2.3</span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2.0.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 2.0.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.0.0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>caret 语法（推荐）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&gt;=1.0.0 &lt;2.0.0</code></td>\n<td>显式范围</td>\n<td>等价于 <code>^1.0.0</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>any</code></td>\n<td>任何版本</td>\n<td>不推荐（破坏可复现性）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>1.2.3</code></td>\n<td>精确版本</td>\n<td>不推荐（限制解析空间）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&gt;=1.2.3-dev.1</code></td>\n<td>包含预发布版</td>\n<td>测试预发布时使用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"版本解析算法\">版本解析算法</h2><p>Pub 使用基于 DPLL（Davis–Putnam–Logemann–Loveland）的约束满足算法来解析依赖。目标是找到满足所有传递约束的<strong>最新兼容版本组合</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[读取 pubspec.yaml] --&gt; B[构建约束图]&#10;    B --&gt; C[选择最新版本尝试]&#10;    C --&gt; D{所有约束满足?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[生成 pubspec.lock]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F{有其他版本可选?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[回溯,选次新版本]&#10;    G --&gt; D&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[报告版本冲突]\">graph TD\n    A[读取 pubspec.yaml] --&gt; B[构建约束图]\n    B --&gt; C[选择最新版本尝试]\n    C --&gt; D{所有约束满足?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[生成 pubspec.lock]\n    D --&gt;|否| F{有其他版本可选?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[回溯,选次新版本]\n    G --&gt; D\n    F --&gt;|否| H[报告版本冲突]</pre><p>当发生版本冲突时，Pub 的错误消息会展示冲突链：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Because my_app depends on package_a ^2.0.0 which depends on&#10;    shared_dep ^1.0.0, my_app requires shared_dep ^1.0.0.&#10;And because my_app depends on package_b ^3.0.0 which depends on&#10;    shared_dep ^2.0.0, version solving failed.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Because my_app depends on package_a ^2.0.0 which depends on</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    shared_dep ^1.0.0, my_app requires shared_dep ^1.0.0.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>And because my_app depends on package_b ^3.0.0 which depends on</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    shared_dep ^2.0.0, version solving failed.</span></span></code></pre></div><p>解决冲突的策略：升级冲突包到兼容版本、使用 <code>dependency_overrides</code>（仅开发期）、或向上游提交兼容性修复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pubspec-lock-与可复现构建\">pubspec.lock 与可复现构建</h2><p><code>pubspec.lock</code> 记录了解析后每个包的精确版本，确保团队成员和 CI 使用完全相同的依赖版本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# pubspec.lock（自动生成，勿手动编辑）&#10;packages:&#10;  http:&#10;    dependency: &#39;direct main&#39;&#10;    description:&#10;      name: http&#10;      sha256: &#39;abc123...&#39;&#10;      url: &#39;https://pub.dev&#39;&#10;    source: hosted&#10;    version: &#39;1.2.1&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># pubspec.lock（自动生成，勿手动编辑）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    dependency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'direct main'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">http</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      sha256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'abc123...'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://pub.dev'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">hosted</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1.2.1'</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>项目类型</th>\n<th>是否提交 lock 文件</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>应用（app）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>保证部署可复现性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库（package）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>允许消费者灵活解析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工作区-workspace-与-monorepo\">工作区（Workspace）与 Monorepo</h2><p>Dart 3.x 引入 workspace 支持，让 monorepo 内的多个包共享依赖解析：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 根 pubspec.yaml&#10;name: _workspace&#10;environment:&#10;  sdk: ^3.12.0&#10;workspace:&#10;  - packages/core&#10;  - packages/client&#10;  - packages/server\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 根 pubspec.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">_workspace</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  sdk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">^3.12.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">workspace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">packages/core</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">packages/client</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">packages/server</span></span></code></pre></div><p>工作区内的包可以通过 <code>path</code> 依赖互相引用，Pub 将所有包视为同一个解析单元——避免了内部包之间的版本冲突。</p>\n<h2 id=\"发布到-pub-dev\">发布到 pub.dev</h2><p>发布包需要经过一系列验证：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 1. 预检查：验证 pubspec、分析代码、检查格式&#10;dart pub publish --dry-run&#10;&#10;# 2. 查看将要上传的文件列表&#10;dart pub publish --dry-run 2&gt;&amp;1 | grep &quot;Package&quot;&#10;&#10;# 3. 正式发布（需要 Google 账号认证）&#10;dart pub publish&#10;&#10;# 4. 撤回有问题的版本（72 小时内）&#10;dart pub downgrade my_package 2.1.0\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1. 预检查：验证 pubspec、分析代码、检查格式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dart</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pub</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> publish</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --dry-run</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2. 查看将要上传的文件列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dart</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pub</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> publish</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --dry-run</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 2>&#x26;1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Package\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 3. 正式发布（需要 Google 账号认证）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dart</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pub</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> publish</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 4. 撤回有问题的版本（72 小时内）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dart</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pub</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> downgrade</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my_package</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2.1.0</span></span></code></pre></div><p>发布前的质量清单：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// analysis_options.yaml — 启用推荐规则集&#10;include: package:lints/recommended.yaml&#10;&#10;analyzer:&#10;  errors:&#10;    missing_return: error&#10;    dead_code: warning&#10;  language:&#10;    strict-casts: true&#10;    strict-raw-types: true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// analysis_options.yaml — 启用推荐规则集</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>include: package:lints/recommended.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>analyzer:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  errors:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    missing_return: error</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    dead_code: warning</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  language:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    strict-casts: true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    strict-raw-types: true</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>发布要求</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>通过 <code>dart analyze</code> 无错误</td>\n<td>有 warning 允许但不推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通过 <code>dart format</code> 检查</td>\n<td>代码格式规范</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pubspec.yaml</code> 完整性</td>\n<td>description、repository、sdk 约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CHANGELOG.md</td>\n<td>记录版本变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LICENSE</td>\n<td>明确授权协议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>README.md</td>\n<td>使用说明与示例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>示例文件 <code>example/</code></td>\n<td>pub.dev 展示示例代码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"pub-dev-评分机制\">pub.dev 评分机制</h2><p>pub.dev 使用 <strong>Pub Points</strong> 系统评估包质量（满分 160 分）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>总分</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>follow</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>provide</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>platform</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>analysis</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>dependency</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{总分} = P_{\\text{follow}} + P_{\\text{provide}} + P_{\\text{platform}} + P_{\\text{analysis}} + P_{\\text{dependency}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总分</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">follow</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">provide</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">platform</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">analysis</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dependency</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>满分</th>\n<th>评估内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Follow conventions</td>\n<td>30</td>\n<td>pubspec 完整、有文档和示例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Provide documentation</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>API 文档覆盖率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Platform support</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>支持的平台数量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pass static analysis</td>\n<td>50</td>\n<td>无错误/无 warning</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Support up-to-date dependencies</td>\n<td>40</td>\n<td>依赖版本不过时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>高分包（140+）获得 &quot;Dart 3 compatible&quot;、&quot;null safety&quot; 等标签加持，在搜索排名中优先展示。</p>\n<h2 id=\"私有包仓库\">私有包仓库</h2><p>企业环境中通常需要私有包仓库：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# pubspec.yaml — 使用私有仓库&#10;dependencies:&#10;  internal_auth:&#10;    hosted:&#10;      name: internal_auth&#10;      url: https://pub.internal.company.com&#10;    version: ^1.0.0&#10;&#10;# 或通过环境变量配置默认仓库&#10;# PUB_HOSTED_URL=https://pub.internal.company.com dart pub get\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># pubspec.yaml — 使用私有仓库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dependencies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  internal_auth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    hosted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">internal_auth</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://pub.internal.company.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">^1.0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 或通过环境变量配置默认仓库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># PUB_HOSTED_URL=https://pub.internal.company.com dart pub get</span></span></code></pre></div><p>私有仓库选项包括：自建 <code>pub_server</code>、Google Artifact Registry、以及 JFrog Artifactory 的 Dart 支持。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Pub 采用版本解析而非版本锁定，在满足所有传递约束的前提下寻找最新兼容组合；冲突时错误消息会展示完整的依赖链。</li>\n<li>约束语法首选 caret <code>^1.2.3</code>，<code>any</code> 与精确版本都破坏可复现性或限制解析空间；<code>dependency_overrides</code> 仅限开发期。</li>\n<li><code>pubspec.lock</code> 保证团队与 CI 使用完全相同的依赖版本——应用提交，库不提交。</li>\n<li>Dart 3.x 的 workspace 让 monorepo 内多个包成为同一个解析单元，内部通过 <code>path</code> 互相引用。</li>\n<li>发布到 pub.dev 需通过 dry-run 预检查、<code>dart analyze</code>、<code>dart format</code>，并具备 CHANGELOG、LICENSE、README 与示例。</li>\n<li>Pub Points（满分 160）从规范遵循、文档、平台支持、静态分析、依赖时效五个维度评估包质量。</li>\n<li>企业环境可通过 <code>hosted</code> 字段或 <code>PUB_HOSTED_URL</code> 指向私有仓库（自建 pub_server、Artifact Registry、Artifactory）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>参阅 <a href=\"testing-debugging\">测试与调试</a> 了解如何在包开发中建立测试流程，以及 <a href=\"dart-server-backend\">Dart 服务端开发</a> 了解如何将包部署为服务端应用。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Pub 包管理与发布","id":"pub-包管理与发布"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"pubspec.yaml 解析","id":"pubspec-yaml-解析"},{"level":2,"text":"版本解析算法","id":"版本解析算法"},{"level":2,"text":"pubspec.lock 与可复现构建","id":"pubspec-lock-与可复现构建"},{"level":2,"text":"工作区（Workspace）与 Monorepo","id":"工作区-workspace-与-monorepo"},{"level":2,"text":"发布到 pub.dev","id":"发布到-pub-dev"},{"level":2,"text":"pub.dev 评分机制","id":"pub-dev-评分机制"},{"level":2,"text":"私有包仓库","id":"私有包仓库"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"FFI 与原生互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/core-libraries/dart-ffi-interop"},"next":{"title":"测试与调试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/ecosystem/testing-debugging"}}